 "template": "In Odoo, open the Sales app and create a new quotation (New). Set the Customer field to '{{v1}}' by typing the name and choosing the matching option from the autocomplete dropdown (the value only counts if the dropdown option is actually selected). Then in the Order Lines tab, add exactly ONE order line: pick any product from the product catalogue by typing in the product field and selecting an option from the autocomplete dropdown, and set the quantity to 3. Let the app fill in the unit price automatically. Do NOT add any other lines. Save the quotation. Then report: the product name you chose, the unit price the app filled in for that line, and the Untaxed Amount the app computes (from the totals section). Do not wait for network idle; wait for concrete page state.",
